    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Fatigue; temperature to 37.8 °C at home; poor appetite</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Positive</td><td>Light-headed on standing; no chest pain, palpitations, or fainting</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Nausea and vomiting, now stopped; watery diarrhea, easing; cramping; no blood, black stool, or severe pain</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Dark urine, passed less often; no dysuria</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Dull headache with the illness; two unplanned sleep episodes while seated; no new weakness, confusion, or falls</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>6 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

